<span class="ot-num">(07)</span> FAQs
</p><h2 class="bde-f-text-60-984 bde-f-text ot-h2" data-entrance="slideUp">
Common Questions.
</h2></div><div class="bde-f-container-60-1007 bde-f-container ot-faq-list" data-entrance="fade"><details class="bde-f-container-60-988 bde-f-container ot-faq"><summary class="bde-f-text-60-986 bde-f-text ot-faq-q">
Is the Website Really Free?
</summary><p class="bde-f-text-60-987 bde-f-text ot-faq-a">
Yes, on Site + Ads. You pay £225 a month for me to run your Google Ads and host the site, and the website itself costs nothing. If you only want a website, it's £75 a month.
</p></details><details class="bde-f-container-60-991 bde-f-container ot-faq"><summary class="bde-f-text-60-989 bde-f-text ot-faq-q">
What If I Want to Leave?
</summary><p class="bde-f-text-60-990 bde-f-text ot-faq-a">
You can leave any time. There's no contract, and your domain, Google Ads account and Google profile are in your name from the start.
</p></details><details class="bde-f-container-60-994 bde-f-container ot-faq"><summary class="bde-f-text-60-992 bde-f-text ot-faq-q">
Can I Stop the Ads but Keep the Site?
</summary><p class="bde-f-text-60-993 bde-f-text ot-faq-a">
Yes. If it's before the 12 months are up, you move onto Site Only at £75 a month and the 12 months carry on.
</p></details><details class="bde-f-container-60-1000 bde-f-container ot-faq"><summary class="bde-f-text-60-998 bde-f-text ot-faq-q">
How Much Should I Spend on Ads?
</summary><p class="bde-f-text-60-999 bde-f-text ot-faq-a">
It depends on your trade and where you work. I'll suggest a starting budget on our first call. You pay Google directly. My fee covers up to £2,000 a month of ad spend, then it's 10%.
</p></details><details class="bde-f-container-60-1003 bde-f-container ot-faq"><summary class="bde-f-text-60-1001 bde-f-text ot-faq-q">
Who Owns the Google Ads Account?
</summary><p class="bde-f-text-60-1002 bde-f-text ot-faq-a">
You do. I manage it, but it's in your name from day one.
</p></details><details class="bde-f-container-60-1006 bde-f-container ot-faq"><summary class="bde-f-text-60-1004 bde-f-text ot-faq-q">
Do I Have to Write Anything?
</summary><p class="bde-f-text-60-1005 bde-f-text ot-faq-a">
No. A chat and a few photos of your work is all I need.
</p></details></div></div></section><div class="bde-f-container-60-1365 bde-f-container ot-bar" id="ot-bar" aria-label="Pricing"><div class="bde-f-container-60-1355 bde-f-container ot-wa"><a class="bde-f-text-link-60-1352 bde-f-text-link ot-wa-tip" href="https://wa.me/447778238523?text=Hi%20Dan%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20Own%20Trade" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
